    "Full independent source/host qualification is not established by the synthetic reconstruction. Schema-valid envelopes/authorization/comparison fragments remain weaker than executed engines.",
    "Original relation table has 17 pairs across 13 relations: 5 resolved and 12 non-resolved. Original narrative 18/13 remains historical overstatement.",
    "The repaired all-object checker is stronger than authoritative Run closure for orphan records; do not invent a source requirement to reject unrelated CAS objects.",
    "Original root limitations on selected relation-annotation traversal, UCD discrimination, synthetic Rust units, normalization and arbitrary malformed helper inputs remain applicable."
  ],
